<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>매드 애비뉴 — 광고가 세상을 움직입니다</title>
  <meta name="description" content="매드 애비뉴 광고대행. 1950년대의 자신감, 21세기의 전략. 브랜드를 스타로 만듭니다." />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Yeseva+One&family=Libre+Franklin:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;0,700;0,800;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    :root{
      --mustard:#e3a91e;
      --mustard-deep:#c98a0a;
      --teal:#1f7a78;
      --teal-deep:#155a59;
      --coral:#e84a5f;
      --cream:#f6ecd4;
      --cream-deep:#efe0bd;
      --ink:#2b2118;
      --ink-soft:#4a3c2c;
      --paper:#fbf4e2;
    }
    *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
    html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
    body{
      font-family:"Libre Franklin",sans-serif;
      background:var(--cream);
      color:var(--ink);
      line-height:1.55;
      -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
      overflow-x:hidden;
    }
    .display{font-family:"Yeseva One",serif;font-weight:400;line-height:0.98;letter-spacing:-0.01em}
    .wrap{max-width:1160px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 28px}
    section{position:relative}

    /* ---- decorative bits ---- */
    .star{display:inline-block;color:var(--coral)}
    .burst-badge{
      position:relative;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
      width:108px;height:108px;font-family:"Yeseva One",serif;color:var(--paper);
      text-transform:uppercase;font-size:0.95rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-align:center;
      background:var(--coral);transform:rotate(-12deg);
      clip-path:polygon(50% 0%,61% 12%,78% 6%,78% 24%,95% 24%,86% 39%,100% 50%,86% 61%,95% 76%,78% 76%,78% 94%,61% 88%,50% 100%,39% 88%,22% 94%,22% 76%,5% 76%,14% 61%,0% 50%,14% 39%,5% 24%,22% 24%,22% 6%,39% 12%);
    }

    /* ---- top nav ---- */
    .nav{
      position:sticky;top:40px;z-index:50;background:var(--teal);
      border-bottom:4px solid var(--mustard);
    }
    .nav .wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:66px}
    .brand{font-family:"Yeseva One",serif;color:var(--cream);font-size:1.5rem;letter-spacing:0.02em;text-decoration:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
    .brand small{font-family:"Libre Franklin";font-weight:700;font-size:0.6rem;letter-spacing:0.28em;color:var(--mustard);text-transform:uppercase}
    .nav-links{display:flex;gap:26px;align-items:center}
    .nav-links a{color:var(--cream);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:0.82rem;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;transition:color .15s}
    .nav-links a:hover{color:var(--mustard)}
    .nav-cta{background:var(--coral);color:var(--paper)!important;padding:9px 18px;border-radius:2px;box-shadow:3px 3px 0 var(--ink)}
    .nav-cta:hover{color:var(--paper)!important;transform:translate(1px,1px);box-shadow:2px 2px 0 var(--ink)}
    @media(max-width:760px){.nav-links a:not(.nav-cta){display:none}}

    /* ---- hero ---- */
    .hero{
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 12% 18%, rgba(255,255,255,.18), transparent 40%),
        repeating-linear-gradient(135deg, var(--mustard) 0 38px, var(--mustard-deep) 38px 76px);
      padding:76px 0 90px;border-bottom:6px solid var(--ink);overflow:hidden;
    }
    .hero .wrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.25fr .85fr;gap:36px;align-items:center}
    .eyebrow{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:var(--ink);color:var(--mustard);padding:7px 15px;font-weight:800;font-size:0.72rem;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;transform:rotate(-1.5deg)}
    .hero h1{font-size:clamp(3rem,8.4vw,6.4rem);color:var(--ink);margin:22px 0 18px;text-shadow:4px 4px 0 var(--cream)}
    .hero h1 .em{color:var(--coral);text-shadow:4px 4px 0 var(--ink)}
    .hero p.lead{font-size:1.18rem;max-width:30ch;color:var(--ink-soft);font-weight:600}
    .hero-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;margin-top:30px}
    .btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;font-size:0.92rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;padding:14px 26px;border-radius:2px;text-transform:uppercase;transition:transform .12s, box-shadow .12s}
    .btn-primary{background:var(--coral);color:var(--paper);box-shadow:5px 5px 0 var(--ink)}
    .btn-primary:hover{transform:translate(2px,2px);box-shadow:3px 3px 0 var(--ink)}
    .btn-ghost{background:var(--ink);color:var(--cream);box-shadow:5px 5px 0 var(--teal-deep)}
    .btn-ghost:hover{transform:translate(2px,2px);box-shadow:3px 3px 0 var(--teal-deep)}

    .hero-art{position:relative;display:flex;justify-content:center}
    .hero-art .speech{
      position:absolute;top:-18px;right:-6px;background:var(--paper);border:3px solid var(--ink);
      padding:12px 16px;font-family:"Yeseva One",serif;font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--coral);
      transform:rotate(4deg);box-shadow:4px 4px 0 var(--ink);z-index:3;
    }
    .hero-art .speech:after{content:"";position:absolute;bottom:-16px;left:24px;border:9px solid transparent;border-top-color:var(--ink)}
    .hero-art .new-badge{position:absolute;bottom:-14px;left:-18px;z-index:3}

    /* ---- marquee strip ---- */
    .strip{background:var(--ink);color:var(--cream);padding:14px 0;overflow:hidden;white-space:nowrap}
    .strip-track{display:inline-block;animation:slide 26s linear infinite;font-family:"Yeseva One",serif;font-size:1.1rem;letter-spacing:0.05em}
    .strip-track span{margin:0 22px}
    .strip-track .dot{color:var(--coral)}
    @keyframes slide{from{transform:translateX(0)}to{transform:translateX(-50%)}}

    /* ---- section header ---- */
    .sec-head{text-align:center;margin:0 auto 44px;max-width:620px}
    .sec-kicker{display:inline-block;font-weight:800;font-size:0.75rem;letter-spacing:0.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--teal);border-bottom:3px solid var(--coral);padding-bottom:4px}
    .sec-head h2{font-size:clamp(2.2rem,5vw,3.4rem);color:var(--ink);margin-top:16px}
    .sec-head p{color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:10px;font-weight:500}

    /* ---- services ---- */
    .services{padding:86px 0;background:var(--cream)}
    .svc-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:26px}
    .svc{
      background:var(--paper);border:3px solid var(--ink);border-radius:4px;padding:30px 26px;
      box-shadow:7px 7px 0 var(--teal);position:relative;transition:transform .14s, box-shadow .14s;
    }
    .svc:nth-child(2){box-shadow:7px 7px 0 var(--coral)}
    .svc:nth-child(3){box-shadow:7px 7px 0 var(--mustard-deep)}
    .svc:nth-child(4){box-shadow:7px 7px 0 var(--coral)}
    .svc:nth-child(5){box-shadow:7px 7px 0 var(--mustard-deep)}
    .svc:nth-child(6){box-shadow:7px 7px 0 var(--teal)}
    .svc:hover{transform:translate(-3px,-3px)}
    .svc .ico{width:60px;height:60px;margin-bottom:16px}
    .svc h3{font-family:"Yeseva One",serif;font-size:1.45rem;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:8px}
    .svc p{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:0.94rem}
    .svc .price{margin-top:16px;font-weight:800;color:var(--teal);font-size:0.92rem;letter-spacing:0.03em}

    /* ---- packages ---- */
    .packages{padding:30px 0 86px;background:var(--cream)}
    .pkg-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px;align-items:stretch}
    .pkg{background:var(--paper);border:3px solid var(--ink);border-radius:4px;padding:30px 26px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;position:relative}
    .pkg.feat{background:var(--teal);color:var(--cream);transform:scale(1.04)}
    .pkg.feat .pkg-name,.pkg.feat .pkg-price{color:var(--cream)}
    .pkg .pkg-name{font-family:"Yeseva One",serif;font-size:1.5rem;color:var(--coral)}
    .pkg .pkg-price{font-family:"Yeseva One",serif;font-size:2.4rem;color:var(--ink);margin:10px 0 4px}
    .pkg .pkg-price small{font-family:"Libre Franklin";font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:700;opacity:.75}
    .pkg ul{list-style:none;margin:18px 0 24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
    .pkg li{font-size:0.92rem;padding-left:24px;position:relative}
    .pkg li:before{content:"★";position:absolute;left:0;color:var(--coral)}
    .pkg.feat li:before{color:var(--mustard)}
    .pkg .btn{margin-top:auto;justify-content:center}
    .pkg-flag{position:absolute;top:-14px;right:18px}

    /* ---- cases ---- */
    .cases{padding:86px 0;background:var(--teal);color:var(--cream);border-top:6px solid var(--ink);border-bottom:6px solid var(--ink)}
    .cases .sec-kicker{color:var(--mustard);border-color:var(--coral)}
    .cases .sec-head h2{color:var(--cream)}
    .cases .sec-head p{color:var(--cream-deep)}
    .case-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:26px}
    .case{background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);border:3px solid var(--ink);border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:8px 8px 0 var(--ink)}
    .case-top{padding:22px 24px;background:var(--mustard);border-bottom:3px solid var(--ink);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:14px}
    .case-top h3{font-family:"Yeseva One",serif;font-size:1.4rem;color:var(--ink)}
    .case-tag{background:var(--coral);color:var(--paper);font-weight:800;font-size:0.68rem;letter-spacing:0.1em;padding:5px 10px;text-transform:uppercase;white-space:nowrap}
    .case-body{padding:22px 24px}
    .case-body p{font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--ink-soft)}
    .case-stats{display:flex;gap:24px;margin-top:18px}
    .case-stats div{flex:1}
    .case-stats .num{font-family:"Yeseva One",serif;font-size:1.9rem;color:var(--teal);line-height:1}
    .case-stats .lbl{font-size:0.72rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:4px}

    /* ---- team ---- */
    .team{padding:86px 0;background:var(--cream)}
    .team-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:22px}
    .member{text-align:center}
    .avatar{width:120px;height:120px;margin:0 auto 14px;border-radius:50%;border:4px solid var(--ink);background:var(--paper);box-shadow:5px 5px 0 var(--mustard);display:block}
    .member:nth-child(2) .avatar{box-shadow:5px 5px 0 var(--coral)}
    .member:nth-child(3) .avatar{box-shadow:5px 5px 0 var(--teal)}
    .member:nth-child(4) .avatar{box-shadow:5px 5px 0 var(--coral)}
    .member h3{font-family:"Yeseva One",serif;font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--ink)}
    .member .role{font-weight:700;font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--teal);margin:4px 0 8px}
    .member p{font-size:0.86rem;color:var(--ink-soft)}

    /* ---- contact ---- */
    .contact{padding:86px 0;background:
      repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, var(--coral) 0 30px, #d8435a 30px 60px);
      border-top:6px solid var(--ink)}
    .contact-card{background:var(--paper);border:4px solid var(--ink);border-radius:6px;box-shadow:10px 10px 0 var(--ink);max-width:920px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
    .contact-info{padding:44px 40px;background:var(--ink);color:var(--cream)}
    .contact-info h2{font-family:"Yeseva One",serif;font-size:2.4rem;color:var(--mustard);line-height:1.05}
    .contact-info p{margin-top:14px;color:var(--cream-deep);font-size:0.96rem}
    .info-list{margin-top:26px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px}
    .info-list div{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start}
    .info-list .k{font-weight:800;font-size:0.72rem;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--coral);min-width:62px;padding-top:2px}
    .info-list .v{font-size:0.95rem}
    .contact-form{padding:40px 36px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px}
    .field label{display:block;font-weight:800;font-size:0.72rem;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:6px}
    .field input,.field textarea,.field select{width:100%;border:3px solid var(--ink);border-radius:3px;padding:11px 13px;font-family:inherit;font-size:0.95rem;background:var(--cream);color:var(--ink)}
    .field input:focus,.field textarea:focus,.field select:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--coral);box-shadow:3px 3px 0 var(--coral)}
    .contact-form .btn{justify-content:center;margin-top:6px}

    /* ---- footer ---- */
    footer{background:var(--ink);color:var(--cream-deep);padding:40px 0;text-align:center}
    footer .brand{justify-content:center;margin-bottom:10px}
    footer p{font-size:0.82rem}
    footer .fineprint{margin-top:8px;color:#8a7a62;font-size:0.74rem}

    @media(max-width:860px){
      .hero .wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .hero-art{margin-top:20px}
      .svc-grid,.pkg-grid,.case-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .pkg.feat{transform:none}
      .team-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
      .contact-card{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<div style="position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:9999;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:8px 16px;background:rgba(7,11,20,0.94);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border-bottom:2px solid #ffb000;font-family:ui-monospace,'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.08em;">
  <a href="/portfolio" style="color:#ffb000;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;">← PORTFOLIO</a>
  <span style="color:#8ea0b8;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;">SAMPLE 29 · 매드 애비뉴 — 1950년대 미국 광고(매드맨) 스타일</span>
  <a href="/contact" style="color:#070b14;background:#ffb000;padding:6px 12px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;border-radius:2px;">제작 문의 →</a>
</div>
<div style="height:40px;"></div>

<!-- NAV -->
<nav class="nav">
  <div class="wrap">
    <a href="#top" class="brand">매드 애비뉴<small>EST. 1958</small></a>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="#services">서비스</a>
      <a href="#cases">성공사례</a>
      <a href="#team">팀</a>
      <a href="#contact" class="nav-cta">상담 예약</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- HERO -->
<header class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <span class="eyebrow"><span class="star">★</span> 광화문에서 태어난 광고 명가</span>
      <h1 class="display">팔리는 건<br/>운이 아니라<br/><span class="em">전략</span>입니다.</h1>
      <p class="lead">한 줄의 카피가 매출을 바꿉니다. 매드 애비뉴는 1958년부터 브랜드를 <strong>스타</strong>로 만들어 왔습니다.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary">무료 캠페인 진단 받기 →</a>
        <a href="#cases" class="btn btn-ghost">성공사례 보기</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-art">
      <div class="speech">"이거, 사야겠는데?"</div>
      <!-- hand-drawn martini -->
      <svg width="280" height="300" viewBox="0 0 280 300" aria-hidden="true">
        <ellipse cx="140" cy="282" rx="78" ry="12" fill="#2b2118" opacity="0.18"/>
        <rect x="134" y="160" width="12" height="108" fill="#2b2118"/>
        <ellipse cx="140" cy="270" rx="46" ry="12" fill="#2b2118"/>
        <path d="M48 56 L232 56 L140 168 Z" fill="#f6ecd4" stroke="#2b2118" stroke-width="6" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
        <path d="M70 78 L210 78 L140 158 Z" fill="#1f7a78"/>
        <path d="M70 78 L210 78 L168 128 L112 128 Z" fill="#2a9491"/>
        <circle cx="172" cy="112" r="11" fill="#e84a5f" stroke="#2b2118" stroke-width="4"/>
        <line x1="172" y1="112" x2="208" y2="50" stroke="#2b2118" stroke-width="4"/>
        <g stroke="#e3a91e" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round">
          <line x1="36" y1="40" x2="36" y2="22"/><line x1="27" y1="31" x2="45" y2="31"/>
        </g>
        <g stroke="#e84a5f" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round">
          <line x1="244" y1="186" x2="244" y2="168"/><line x1="235" y1="177" x2="253" y2="177"/>
        </g>
        <text x="60" y="216" font-family="Yeseva One, serif" font-size="34" fill="#c98a0a" transform="rotate(-8 60 216)">Cheers!</text>
      </svg>
      <div class="new-badge">
        <span class="burst-badge">무료<br/>진단!</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- MARQUEE -->
<div class="strip">
  <div class="strip-track">
    <span>광고는 예술이다 <span class="dot">●</span></span><span>한 줄로 마음을 산다 <span class="dot">●</span></span><span>NEW! 디지털 풀서비스 <span class="dot">●</span></span><span>67년의 카피 내공 <span class="dot">●</span></span><span>광고는 예술이다 <span class="dot">●</span></span><span>한 줄로 마음을 산다 <span class="dot">●</span></span><span>NEW! 디지털 풀서비스 <span class="dot">●</span></span><span>67년의 카피 내공 <span class="dot">●</span></span>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- SERVICES -->
<section class="services" id="services">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="sec-kicker">우리가 하는 일</span>
      <h2 class="display">아이디어를 매출로.</h2>
      <p>전략부터 한 줄 카피, 영상, 디지털 집행까지 — 광고의 처음과 끝을 책임집니다.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="svc-grid">
      <div class="svc">
        <svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none"><circle cx="24" cy="24" r="20" fill="#e3a91e" stroke="#2b2118" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M14 28 L22 18 L28 26 L36 16" stroke="#2b2118" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><circle cx="36" cy="16" r="3" fill="#e84a5f" stroke="#2b2118" stroke-width="2"/></svg>
        <h3>브랜드 전략</h3>
        <p>시장과 소비자를 읽고 브랜드의 한 문장을 정의합니다. 포지셔닝과 메시지 골격 설계.</p>
        <div class="price">₩ 350만~ / 프로젝트</div>
      </div>
      <div class="svc">
        <svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none"><rect x="8" y="10" width="32" height="24" rx="2" fill="#1f7a78" stroke="#2b2118" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M14 18h14M14 24h20" stroke="#f6ecd4" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M30 40 l4-6 4 6 z" fill="#e84a5f" stroke="#2b2118" stroke-width="2"/></svg>
        <h3>카피라이팅</h3>
        <p>읽히는 헤드라인, 팔리는 바디카피. 슬로건·네이밍·스크립트까지 글로 승부합니다.</p>
        <div class="price">₩ 180만~ / 캠페인</div>
      </div>
      <div class="svc">
        <svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none"><circle cx="24" cy="24" r="20" fill="#e84a5f" stroke="#2b2118" stroke-width="3"/><polygon points="20,16 34,24 20,32" fill="#f6ecd4" stroke="#2b2118" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        <h3>영상·CF 제작</h3>
        <p>15초로 각인되는 광고 영상. 콘티·연출·편집까지 인하우스 프로덕션.</p>
        <div class="price">₩ 600만~ / 편</div>
      </div>
      <div class="svc">
